  "integration": {
    "body": "Replace only body layer. Apply attachment_offset to every other layer destination and pivot, grip, support_hand and muzzle.",
    "clock": "Advance run independently of aim and fire. Preserve clock when changing direction; recoil must not replace body animation.",
    "mirror": "Mirror completed composition and anchors around x64. Backpedaling reverses cycle playback, not facing.",
    "jump": "Use takeoff, rising, apex, falling, landing according to physics phase. Single authored hold per jump phase.",
    "hurt": "Stationary hurt frame only; moving hurt retains locomotion with hit flash.",
    "death": "No weapon layers. Recoil 0.14s then falling hold until grounded. On ground play impact0.18s then settle at least0.27s; never loop. Minimum total1.0s and grounded0.45s.",
    "hud": "24x24 maximum head icon, preserve source aspect; one per total remaining life.",
    "scope": "Tony pressure-gun and Sean heavy-plunger-launcher only. Other weapon combinations require grip/occlusion review."
  },
